cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "State-Space Unlearning for Non-Stationary Bias in Land Surface Forecasting"
abstract: >-
  SSU-LSF is a machine-unlearning framework for Mamba-family structured state space
  models used in land surface forecasting. It localizes a temporal confounding
  footprint from EKFac influence scores, then applies Hessian-free projected
  gradient ascent inside a KL-divergence trust region with spatial total-variation
  regularization, removing non-stationary bias at a fraction of the cost of full
  retraining.
type: conference-paper
version: 1.0.0
